<title>FRANCE: French bond futures end off in moderate trade.</title>
<headline>French bond futures end off in moderate trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>1500 GMT - French bond and PIBOR futures closed lower after a moderate day of trading that saw French markets unable to capitalise on friendly U.S. data. Reports on U.S. April CPI, industrial production and May Philly Fed index all subdued.</p>
<p>*Jun 10-yr future 130.26, off 0.38. Vol 150,992. Low 130.20</p>
<p>*5.50 2007 OAT yld 5.57 pct vs 5.54. Bund spd unch at -14 bp</p>
<p>*Call money unch at 3-1/8 1/4 pct. Jun PIBOR 96.48, off 8 bp</p>
</text>
